one;\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"background:#006395;height:30px;line-height:30px;color:#fff;text-indent:1em;\"><p style=\"line-height: 3em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Product Lines</strong></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1. submersible pump</span></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">5. submersible drainage pump</span></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2. stainless steel impeller pump</span></td><td valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">6. sewage submersible pump</span></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">3. submersible peripheral pump</span></td><td valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">7. self-suction screw pump</span></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">4. submersible screw pump</span></td><td valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">8. pump starting controller</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">Jiadi pumps are well exported to Europe, South America, Asia, Africa and Oceania, covering more than 70 countries and regions, and enjoy good reputation in clients and users.</p><p><img alt=\"about.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201810301349148359113.jpg\" title=\"about.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" frame=\"box\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"background:#006395;height:30px;line-height:30px;color:#fff;text-indent:1em;\"><p style=\"line-height: 3em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Product Application</strong></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" frame=\"box\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"border:none;\"><img alt=\"about2.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201810301401185291689.jpg\" style=\"max-width:40%;float:left;margin-right:15px;\" title=\"about2.jpg\"/><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">Jiadi pumps are widely used in agricultural irrigation and drainage, factories, mines, construction, urban and rural household uses. Especially for pumping deep well underground water and transporting clean or dirty water.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" frame=\"box\" style=\"border: none;\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"background:#006395;height:30px;line-height:30px;color:#fff;text-indent:1em;\"><p style=\"line-height: 3em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Production Equipment</strong></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><table bordercolor=\"#eee\" frame=\"below\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td><p>We are not only assembling pumps, but also capable of casting, cable and capacitor production, winding, various of process machining, leakage test, performance test and many others. We are controlling the quality and cost from the beginning spare parts. Every year, more than 1 million of Jiadi pumps are delivered to all over the world just because of the high quality and also high cost performance. And we also offer custom molding and machining.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table border=\"0\" bordercolor=\"#eee\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" frame=\"box\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\" style=\"vertical-align:top\"><td style=\"border:1px solid #eee;\" width=\"32%\"><img alt=\"f1.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201809051551303099481.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:10px;\" title=\"f1.jpg\"/></td><td style=\"border:none\"